WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.891
This visual shows the effect of changing grain The
source table has one

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:11.592
row per order After DATE_TRUNC and GROUP BY the
result has

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:17.914
one row per month The chart is not just a different
display It

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:23.559
represents a different analytical grain Always be
clear about what one

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:25.809
row means before and after aggregation
